  "fragment": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-lqf-f-shriek-composition}\nLet $f : X \\to Y$ and $g : Y \\to Z$ be composable locally\nquasi-finite morphisms of schemes. Then $g_! \\circ f_! = (g \\circ f)_!$\nand $f^! \\circ g^! = (g \\circ f)^!$.\n\\end{lemma}",
